25" Revised="2015-11-30" Size="843462"/><ukm:Alternative URI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/uksi/1987/1967/pdfs/uksi_19871967_301114_en.pdf" Date="2015-04-02" Revised="2014-11-30" Size="845162"/><ukm:Alternative URI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/uksi/1987/1967/pdfs/uksi_19871967_280215_en.pdf" Date="2015-07-29" Revised="2015-02-28" Size="844172"/><ukm:Alternative URI="http://www.legislation.gov.uk/uksi/1987/1967/pdfs/uksi_19871967_310515_en.pdf" Date="2015-07-29" Revised="2015-05-31" Size="842832"/></ukm:Alternatives>

